<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu firms to 4.5900 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu firms to 4.5900 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu rose to 4.5900 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange on Wednesday from 4.6340 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>				   Mar 26	 Mar 25</p>
<p> lei per dollar		 4.5900	 4.6340</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	 1,150,000	799,000</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
